    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the differences in 30 moving artworks. There are no timers, no lives, just differences! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 abstract LCL artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 artworks provided Courtesy National Gallery of Art, Washington</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original &quot;Last Child Left&quot; soundtrack, with lo-fi ambience and chilled beats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game assistance, to help with the tougher differences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable speed, to suit your style of play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable color palettes to fit moods or help find differences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient soundtrack choices, such as, sea, rain, and garden, to help with your relaxation needs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
